# Third-party notices

Cumulus://Mail can optionally load two routing datasets. They are not committed.
`node scripts/fetch-geo.mjs` downloads them into `data/geo/` (gitignored) and
checks each file against the official `.sha256sum` asset and
`data/geo/geo.lock.json`. A checksum mismatch stops the fetch and writes nothing.

Only the v2fly releases below are used. Loyalsoldier and sing-box geo data
are not used; those projects publish under GPL-3.

